  "detail_text": "The Naval Surface Warfare Center Philadelphia intends to procure (1) 20 foot storage container in accordance with Section C, Statement of Work of the attached RFQ . This procurement will be on a total small business set-aside basis. The contract will be Firm Fixed Price. All responses must be sent to Brooke Steele at brooke.a.steele3.civ@us.navy.mil no later than 5:30 PM EST on 27 March 2026. Please send signed copy of amended RFQ with quotation submission. Phone calls will NOT be accepted.",
